<!-- Google's own path, from google/material-design-icons
     (symbols/android/hourglass_empty/materialsymbolsrounded), at GRADE 200 to
     match ic_check - the two share a switch thumb, so they have to share a
     stroke weight.

     The name is misleading and worth writing down before someone "corrects" it:
     hourglass_EMPTY draws BOTH bulbs filled, and is the fullest of the family.
     hourglass_full is the bare silhouette with no sand in it at all, and
     hourglass_top has sand in the upper bulb only. The two that are wrong on
     meaning rather than looks are hourglass_bottom, whose sand has fallen and
     so reads as FINISHED, and hourglass_disabled, which is crossed out. -->
